### P2.12 â€” `xmalloc`/`xrealloc` in matcher.c duplicate `ncd_malloc`/`ncd_realloc`
- **File:** `src/matcher.c` lines 39â€“51
- **Problem:** Matcher has its own `xmalloc` that does `malloc + exit(1) on NULL`. The project already has `ncd_malloc()` in `../shared/common.c`.
