### P2.13 â€” Service `load_all_drive_databases()` duplicates `service_state_load_databases()`
- **Files:** `src/state_backend_local.c` (56â€“113), `src/service_state.c` (175â€“267)
- **Problem:** Both enumerate drives, check file existence, load per-drive DB, merge. Only difference: service version adds status messages and exclusion filtering.
