### P2.14 â€” Retry logic copy-pasted in 4 service state_backend functions
- **File:** `src/state_backend_service.c` lines 807â€“921
- **Problem:** `submit_heuristic`, `submit_metadata`, `request_rescan`, `request_flush` all have identical retry loops.
- **Fix:** Extract `submit_with_retry(do_fn)`.

### P2.15 â€” `strlen(partial)` recomputed in loop in agent completion
- **File:** `src/main.c` lines 3558, 3575, 3594
